                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not one to usually write a negative review, but this has so many issues it's unplayable... the camera rig is a full couple feet in the air, so if you drop something on the floor you can't pick it back up... my friend and I were playing at the same time for fun seeing who could beat it first, and we both kept dropping items on the floor or having the item spazz out in our hand when it hit a static object and disappear. This made it so we couldn't progress through the game at all. You can see z-fighting all over the place, one of the walls doesn't even meet the ceiling, there's a strange beeping sound (the bomb maybe?). The puzzles seem fine, I just couldn't get more than two solved before the game would become unplayable... if you can fix some of the issues I'd be happy to try it again. Good luck!",
